  "title_zh": "习近平连续第三年同莫迪会晤，指引中印关系",
  "title_en": "Xi Jinping Meets Modi for Third Consecutive Year, Charting China-India Ties",
  "summary_zh": "当地时间9月12日，习近平主席同印度总理莫迪举行会晤，这是继喀山、天津会晤后双方连续第三年举行会晤。",
  "summary_en": "On September 12 local time, President Xi Jinping met with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi, their third consecutive annual meeting following the Kazan and Tianjin meetings.",
